    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581660/extras/040f13eec80f55711b328959adcf6f34.poster.avif?t=1639903715\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581660/extras/040f13eec80f55711b328959adcf6f34.webm?t=1639903715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581660/extras/040f13eec80f55711b328959adcf6f34.mp4?t=1639903715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>LOOSEPO is an ultra-lightweight Top-down shooting game. In the game, you need to continuously recycle your empty wine bottles to replenish ammunition. With the upgrade of levels, the enemy becomes more and more difficult to deal with, and you should match the initial ability cards reasonably. And upgrade cards in the game to get the final victory<br>\u00b7Fast-paced round challenge<br>\u00b7Procedurally generated small room<br>\u00b7 More than twelve initial cards<br>\u00b7 Challenges with powerful enemies and increasingly difficult items<br>\u00b7Remember to make more money",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581660/extras/040f13eec80f55711b328959adcf6f34.poster.avif?t=1639903715\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581660/extras/040f13eec80f55711b328959adcf6f34.webm?t=1639903715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581660/extras/040f13eec80f55711b328959adcf6f34.mp4?t=1639903715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>LOOSEPO is an ultra-lightweight Top-down shooting game. In the game, you need to continuously recycle your empty wine bottles to replenish ammunition. With the upgrade of levels, the enemy becomes more and more difficult to deal with, and you should match the initial ability cards reasonably. And upgrade cards in the game to get the final victory<br>\u00b7Fast-paced round challenge<br>\u00b7Procedurally generated small room<br>\u00b7 More than twelve initial cards<br>\u00b7 Challenges with powerful enemies and increasingly difficult items<br>\u00b7Remember to make more money",
